  "goodToKnow": "Aufdecken means to uncover or expose: einen Betrug aufdecken, Missstände aufdecken. In card games, die Karten aufdecken means to show one's cards, also figuratively. The opposite is vertuschen (to cover up). Investigative journalism that exposes wrongdoing is called aufdeckender Journalismus. Compare entdecken (to discover) and verdecken (to conceal). Separable: deckte auf, aufgedeckt."
